<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43125" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑτερο-γενής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of different kinds</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Cat.</u>
					1b16
				</span></i>
			; of animals, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HA</u>
				601a25
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑ. ζῷα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.370
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾠά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					14.7.28
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ἑτερογενῶν σωμάτων
			ὑπάρξαι</span>, of Centaurs, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				4.8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόρια</span>, i.e. not paired,
				<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				16.14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>of different kind</i> or <i>race</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Demetr.
			</span></i> Lac. <i><span class="en">
				1012.36
			</span></i> F., <i><span class="en">
				D.T.
				635.7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ἑτερότης] ἑ. καὶ ἀλλόφυλος πρὸς
					αὐτήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					308
				</span></i>
			; simply, <i>different</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πράξεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					1.9
				</span></i>
			. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῶς, διαφέρειν
				ἀλλήλων</span> S.E.M.<i><span class="en">
				7.361
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nicom.
				<u>Ar.</u>
				1.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>of diverse materials</i>, of a garment, <i><span class="en">
				Sm.
				<u>De.</u>
				22.11
			</span></i>: generally, <i>complex</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμογενής</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Demetr.
			</span></i> Lac.<i><span class="en">
				1429.2
			</span></i> F. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Gramm.,
				<i>of different gender</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Conj.</u>
				243.1
			</span></i> (s.v.l.); -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γενές, τό</span>, <i>change of gender</i> in a
				<i>constructio ad sensum</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phoeb.
				<u>Fig.</u>
				1.5
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
